<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Feb unemployment steady at 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Feb unemployment steady at 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	FEB 97   JAN 97   FEB 96</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce     4.1	4.1	3.8</p>
<p> Total			    289,276  301,982  294,260</p>
<p>NOTE - The February and January 1997 figures were calculated according to European Union standards. The February 1996 figure is not directly comparable. The February 1997 figure is an extrapolation by the Austrian Labour Market Service from final Eurostat data for December.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112</p>
</text>
